      "   - AtEase Study Results CAPS - 5 Total Score Mean Change from Baseline -25 -20 -15 -10 -5 0 Wk 0\n",
      "     Wk 2 Wk 4 Wk 6 Wk 8 Wk 10 Wk 12 Placebo TNX-102 SL 2.8 mg TNX-102 SL 5.6 mg * * p=0.031 ,\n",
      "     comparing placebo and TNX - 102 SL 5.6 mg, * p<0.05, comparing placebo and TNX - 102 SL 2.8\n",
      "     mg, by MMRM with MI, mixed-effect model repeated measures with multiple imputation; CAPS - 5\n",
      "     , Clinician Administered PTSD Scale for DSM - 5; LS Mean, least squares mean LS Mean Change *\n",
