      "   - AtEase Study Results CAPS - 5 Arousal and Reactivity Cluster Score Mean Change -7 -6 -5 -4 -3\n",
      "     -2 -1 0 Wk 0 Wk 2 Wk 4 Wk 6 Wk 8 Wk 10 Wk 12 Placebo TNX-102 SL 2.8 mg TNX-102 SL 5.6 mg * *\n",
