     "text": [
      "C:\\Users\\rzhan\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\ipykernel_12144\\3785007544.py:35: FutureWarning: The `get_sentence_embedding_dimension` method has been renamed to `get_embedding_dimension`.\n",
