     "text": [
      "\n",
      "PCA fitted on all rows, then cross-validated (leaks): AUC 0.658\n",
      "PCA refitted inside each fold (honest):               AUC 0.659\n",
      "Difference: -0.001\n",
      "\n",
      "Analysis table for Questions 2-4: 2482 rows x 113 columns (50 text components, 1537 flagged by Q1b)\n"
     ]
